{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 28, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps28 (17 chars). Cry from the pit -> thanksgiving. Heart-contrast: ra evil in wicked's hearts v3 / my lev trusts+exults v7. shalom peace on hypocritical lips. trust->help->exult (batach/azar/alaz). barak x2 (v6 bless LORD / v9 bless heritage). Poetic ledger; span-id pairs.",
  "spans": {
    "276329": {"gloss":"call v1","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"call / cry (qara)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276329,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"call"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (my rock)","to":276329,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'To you, O LORD, I CALL (qara); my rock, be not deaf' — the urgent appeal against divine silence; qara the cry that dreads God's non-answer ('lest I become like those who go down to the pit')"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276348": {"gloss":"wicked v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wicked (resha'im)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (David not dragged with them)","to":276348,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with workers of evil","from":276348,"to":276350,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deprecated ('Do not drag me off WITH the wicked')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Do not drag me off with the WICKED (resha'im)' — the plea not to share their fate; resha'im the company whose doom David begs to escape (cf Ps26:9 not swept with sinners)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276350": {"gloss":"evil(aven) v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity / evil (aven - workers of evil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the workers of evil","to":276350,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the wicked","from":276350,"to":276348,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with the workers of EVIL (aven)' — the doers of iniquity; aven = trouble/wickedness, the practised evil that defines the company alongside the resha'im"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276352": {"gloss":"peace v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"peace (shalom - speak peace)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (on their lips)","to":276352,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"speak","to":276352,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"their neighbours","to":276352,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"contrasted with evil in the heart","from":276352,"to":276354,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'who speak PEACE (shalom) with their neighbours while evil is in their hearts' — the hypocrisy of the wicked; shalom on the lips masking ra within, the split between spoken peace and inner malice"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276354": {"gloss":"evil(ra) v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"evil (ra - in their hearts)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":276354,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"seated in the heart","from":276354,"to":276356,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'while EVIL (ra) is in their hearts' — the malice hidden behind peaceable words; ra lodged in the lev, the true content of the hypocrite's heart (contrast the psalmist's trusting heart, v7)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276356": {"gloss":"hearts v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (levav - of the wicked)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":276356,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked","to":276356,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"where evil is seated","from":276356,"to":276354,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'evil is in their HEARTS (levav)' — the seat of the wicked's malice; levav here the heart of the hypocrite, harbouring ra behind peaceable speech, set against the psalmist's lev that trusts and exults (v7)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276359": {"gloss":"evil(roa) v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"evil / wickedness (roa - of their deeds)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wicked (their deeds)","to":276359,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'according to the EVIL (roa) of their deeds' — the wickedness by which they are to be repaid; roa = the badness of their doings, the measure of the requital David asks God to render"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276379": {"gloss":"Blessed v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"bless (barak - Blessed be the LORD)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276379,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"bless"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276379,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'BLESSED (barak) be the LORD! For he has heard' — the turn to thanksgiving; barak the blessing that answers the heard cry, the hinge from lament to praise (recurs v9)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276389": {"gloss":"heart(trust) v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - in him my heart trusts)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":276389,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276389,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"trusts","from":276389,"to":276390,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'in him my HEART (lev) trusts, and I am helped' — the trusting heart; the direct antithesis of v3's heart full of evil — the psalmist's lev is the seat of faith, not malice"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276390": {"gloss":"trusts v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"trust (batach)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David's heart","from":276390,"to":276389,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"trust"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276390,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with being helped","from":276390,"to":276391,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my heart TRUSTS (batach), and I am helped' — trust rewarded with help; batach the reliance that opens the trust->help->exult sequence, God the strength and shield relied on"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276391": {"gloss":"helped v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be helped (azar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276391,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be helped"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the fruit of trust, leads to exulting","from":276391,"to":276393,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and I am HELPED (azar)' — the answer to trust; azar (recurs Ps22) the help received that turns into exultation, the middle term between trusting and rejoicing"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276392": {"gloss":"heart(exult) v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - my heart exults)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":276392,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276392,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"exults","from":276392,"to":276393,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my HEART (lev) exults' — the same heart now leaping with joy; the trusting heart (v7a) becomes the exulting heart, the inner movement from reliance to rejoicing complete"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276393": {"gloss":"exults v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"exult / leap for joy (alaz)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David's heart","from":276393,"to":276392,"res":"span"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"exult"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with giving thanks","from":276393,"to":276395,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my heart EXULTS (alaz), and with my song I give thanks' — the joy overflowing into praise; alaz = to leap/triumph, the culmination of the trust->help->exult movement, issuing in thanksgiving"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276395": {"gloss":"give thanks v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"give thanks (yadah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":276395,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"give thanks"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":276395,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"with my song","to":276395,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the exulting heart","from":276395,"to":276393,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'with my song I GIVE THANKS (yadah) to him' — the exulting heart voiced; yadah (recurs Ps18:49) the thanksgiving in which the whole inner movement of trust and joy finds expression"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276400": {"gloss":"saving v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (yeshuah - saving refuge)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the LORD (for his anointed)","to":276400,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"his anointed","to":276400,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he is the SAVING (yeshuah) refuge of his anointed' — God as the stronghold of salvation for his king and people; yeshuah here the shelter that saves, widening from the individual to the anointed and the nation"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276404": {"gloss":"save v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"save (yasha)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (asked to)","to":276404,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"save"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"your people","to":276404,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with bless","from":276404,"to":276406,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Oh, SAVE (yasha) your people and bless your heritage!' — the closing intercession; yasha widened from self to the whole people, the personal salvation enlarged to a corporate plea (cf Ps3:8)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276406": {"gloss":"bless v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"bless (barak)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"God (asked to)","to":276406,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"bless"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"your heritage (the people)","to":276406,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"forever","to":276406,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with save","from":276406,"to":276404,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and BLESS (barak) your heritage! Be their shepherd and carry them forever' — barak now turned from praising God (v6) to asking God's blessing on the people; the psalm closing with the shepherd-image of God carrying his flock"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "276336": {"gloss":"pleas v2","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pleas for mercy (tachanun)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v2: 'Hear the voice of my PLEAS for mercy (tachanun)... when I lift up my hands toward your sanctuary' - the supplication of the outstretched hands; tachanun = the cry for grace, the posture of the petitioner reaching toward God's holy place"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "276370": {"gloss":"regard v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"regard / discern (bin - do not regard, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v5: 'Because they do not REGARD (bin) the works of the LORD... he will tear them down' - the wicked's willful blindness; bin negated = their failure to discern God's works, the inner cause of their downfall, disregard breeding ruin"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
